ort. Clean component architecture.',\n    url: 'https://matthieuhuguet.com/reels/game-ui-react',\n    tags: ['React', 'UI/UX', 'Game UI', 'Tool'],\n  },\n  {\n    id: 12,\n    title: 'Water Wheel',\n    brand: 'Houdini',\n    description: 'Geometrie procedurale roue a aubes + simulation eau FLIP. Parametres : taille, nombre de seaux, vieillissement bois, croissance mousse.',\n    descriptionEn: 'Procedural water wheel geometry + FLIP water simulation. Parametric: size, bucket count, wood aging, moss growth.',\n    url: 'https://matthieuhuguet.com/reels/water-wheel',\n    tags: ['Houdini', 'FLIP', 'Procedural', 'Simulation'],\n  },\n  {\n    id: 1,\n    title: 'Pampa Grass HDA',\n    brand: 'Houdini HDA · UE5',\n    description: 'HDA vegetation modulaire. Architecture : fibre, colonne, tiges, herbe. Vertex color SSS + masque vent. Variations infinies, LOD support.',\n    descriptionEn: 'Modular vegetation HDA. Architecture: fiber, column, stems, grass. Vertex color SSS + wind mask. Infinite variations, LOD support.',\n    url: 'https://matthieuhuguet.com/reels/pampa-grass',\n    tags: ['Houdini', 'VEX', 'HDA', 'Vegetation', 'UE5'],\n  },\n  {\n    id: 14,\n    title: 'MagickSlides',\n    brand: 'Python · ImageMagick',\n    description: 'Generation de slides premium via ImageMagick + execution de code. Construit avec Cursor IDE + Gemini Agent.',\n    descriptionEn: 'Premium slide generation via ImageMagick + code execution. Built with Cursor IDE + Gemini Agent.',\n    url: 'https://matthieuhuguet.com/reels/magick-slides',\n    tags: ['Python', 'Tool', 'Automation'],\n  },\n  {\n    id: 35,\n    title: 'Noyes & LISAA Games 2021-2023',\n    brand: 'Unity · LISAA Paris',\n    description: \"Trailer compilation 7 jeux. Lead GD & Programmer sur Noyes (graduation project, jeu narratif atmospherique), Sea Of Love, Beat'em Up, Juryoku To, Turtle Quest, Crazy Kamikaze, Koldstare.\",\n    descriptionEn: \"Trailer compilation of 7 games. Lead GD & Programmer on Noyes (graduation project, atmospheric narrative game), Sea Of Love, Beat'em Up, Juryoku To, Turtle Quest, Crazy Kamikaze, Koldstare.\",\n    url: 'https://youtu.be/iWGyNtTCxaI',\n    tags: ['Unity', 'Game Design', 'Narrative', 'Lead'],\n  },\n];\n\n/* ─── Sub-components ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */\n\nfunction Dots({ value }) {\n  return (\n    <span style={{ display: 'flex', gap: 3, alignItems: 'center', marginLeft: 8 }}>\n      {Array.from({ length: 5 }).map((_, i) => (\n        <span key={i} style={{\n          width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: '50%', flexShrink: 0, display: 'inline-block',\n          background: i < value ? '#3b82f6' : S[100],\n        }} />\n      ))}\n    </span>\n  );\n}\n\nfunction Tag({ label }) {\n  return (\n    <span style={{\n      display: 'inline-block',\n      fontFamily: MONO, fontSize: 10,\n      color: S[500], background: S[100],\n      borderRadius: 4, padding: '2px 6px',\n      marginRight: 4, marginBottom: 4,\n    }}>\n      {label}\n    </span>\n  );\n}\n\nfunction SkillBlock({ s }) {\n  return (\n    <div style={{ marginBottom: 10 }}>\n      <div style={{ display: 'flex', alignItems: 'baseline', justifyContent: 'space-between', marginBottom: 2 }}>\n        <span style={{ fontFamily: SERIF, fontSize: 14, color: S[800] }}>{s.name}</span>\n        <Dots value={s.level} />\n      </div>\n      {s.tags && (\n        <div style={{ display: 'flex', flexWrap: 'wrap' }}>\n          {s.tags.map(tag => <Tag key={tag} label={tag} />)}\n        </div>\n      )}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nfunction Section({ title, children, action }) {\n  return (\n    <section style={{ marginBottom: 40 }}>\n      <div style={{ display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingBottom: 8, marginBottom: 16, borderBottom: `1px solid ${S[100]}` }}>\n        <h2 style={{ fontFamily: SERIF, fontWeight: 600, color: S[900], fontSize: 16, margin: 0 }}>{title}</h2>\n        {action}\n      </div>\n      {children}\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n\n/* ─── Main ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */\n\nexport default function CVPage({ lang: initialLang, isMobile }) {\n  const [lang, setLang] = useState(initialLang === 'fr' ? 'fr' : 'en');\n  const en = lang === 'en';\n\n  const groupedSkills = {\n    core:   skills.filter(s => s.category === 'core'),\n    engine: skills.filter(s => s.category === 'engine'),\n    tools:  skills.filter(s => s.category === 'tools'),\n  };\n\n  const langRows = [\n    { lang: 'French',   level: en ? 'Native'            : 'Natif',             dots: 5 },\n    { lang: 'English',  level: en ? 'Fluent (C1+)'      : 'Courant (C1+)',      dots: 4 },\n    { lang: 'Japanese', level: en ? 'Intermediate (N4)' : 'Intermediaire (N4)', dots: 2 },\n  ];\n\n  const summary = en\n    ? 'Technical Artist specializing in Houdini + Unreal Engine 5. From procedural modeling to pipeline architecture - I design the systems studios need to scale production, automate workflows, and ship environments at a high visual standard. Tool development in Python, C++ and MCP. Bachelor Game Design LISAA Paris (2023) · Gnomon Online · CS50 Harvard (2024).'\n    : \"Technical Artist specialise Houdini + Unreal Engine 5. De la modelisation procedurale a l'architecture pipeline - je concois les systemes dont les studios ont besoin pour scaler leur production et livrer a un haut niveau visuel. Developpement d'outils Python, C++ et MCP. Bachelor Game Design LISAA Paris (2023) · Gnomon Online · CS50 Harvard (2024).\";\n\n  const available = en\n    ? 'Open to contract & freelance remote · min. 3 months'\n    : 'Disponible contrat & freelance remote · min. 3 mois';\n\n  const nonDiversExp = experiences.filter(e => !e.divers);\n  const nonDiversEdu = education.filter(e => !e.divers);\n\n  const diversItems = [\n    ...experiences.filter(e => e.divers).map(e => ({\n      period: e.period,\n      sortYear: parseInt(e.period.match(/\\d{4}/)?.[0] ?? '0'),\n      title: e.title,\n    